<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>

<title>
Graphing Workspace
</title>

<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">

</head>


<body>


<header>

<nav class="navbar">

<div class="logo">
Math<span>Master</span>
</div>


<div class="nav-links">

<a href="/teacher/math-tools">
Math Tools
</a>

<a href="/logout">
Logout
</a>

</div>

</nav>

</header>



<main class="dashboard">


<div class="dashboard-header">

<h1>
📊 Graphing Workspace
</h1>

<p>
Interactive coordinate graphing and gradient tools for mathematics lessons.
</p>

</div>



<div class="dashboard-card">


<h2>
📊 Coordinate Plane
</h2>

<p>
Draw and explore the Cartesian coordinate plane.
</p>


<button
onclick="drawGraph()"
class="btn primary">

📊 Draw Coordinate Plane

</button>


<button
onclick="clearGraph()"
class="btn">

Clear

</button>


<br><br>


<canvas
id="graphCanvas"
width="500"
height="400"
style="border:1px solid black;">
</canvas>


</div>



<div class="dashboard-card">


<h2>
📍 Point Plotter
</h2>

<p>
Plot and label points on the coordinate plane.
</p>


<label>
X Coordinate:
</label>


<input
type="number"
id="graphPointX"
value="3"
>


<br><br>


<label>
Y Coordinate:
</label>


<input
type="number"
id="graphPointY"
value="2"
>


<br><br>


<label>
Label:
</label>


<input
type="text"
id="graphPointLabel"
value="A"
>


<br><br>


<button
onclick="plotGraphPoint()"
class="btn primary">

📍 Plot Point

</button>


<p id="graphPointResult">

Point:

</p>


</div>



<div class="dashboard-card">


<h2>
📈 Line & Gradient
</h2>

<p>
Select two plotted points to draw a line and calculate its gradient.
</p>


<button
onclick="calculateGradient()"
class="btn primary">

📈 Calculate Gradient

</button>


<p id="gradientResult">

Gradient:

</p>


</div>



</main>



<script src="/js/graphing-tools.js"></script>


</body>

</html>
